  "bio": "Alessandro Knowledgeable, operating under the moniker @akkademy_tattoo, is regarded as a master of the distinctive 'trashpolka' tattoo style right in the heart of Milan, Italy. His clients often rave about not only the unique and striking designs he creates but also the exceptional cleanliness and sterilization practices he maintains in his studio. Newcomers and tattoo enthusiasts alike flock to Alessandro for a piece of art crafted with unparalleled professionalism.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Milan, Lombardy, Italy"
